      "value": "You could possibly stream your desktop over youtube through live streaming somehow then past the url in those screens. It would be using the same bandwidth as bigscreen beta im pretty sure. But people can just change the url quickly. What they should do is make it so people cant just go change the url on you every frigen time it gets annoying.",
