      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5af9c90dadc88e31c5bb5150|full_name}: Yeah I just found out virtual desktop comes with a tool that does the same thing, it's a somewhat workable solution.\n\nAlso I found out \"Bigscreen\" lets you stream your desktop to other people in VR, so it must not be as hard to do as I thought. Seems plausible for VRChat to have that someday.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
