      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You've provided an adequate solution that is already possible in your request. Just stream your desktop to a private youtube stream and use the existing video player. Performant and secure computer conferencing software is complex, I think it's a little too far outside the scope of this game. Some platforms also have this functionality built-in for client-side only (WMR 1903), it's possible other platforms will begin to add support as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
